uld like to remotely manage a network, we offer what we call Racket Cloud. So like I said before, you do not have to set up your own VPN. Client and service can talk over the Racky Cloud. And from a data privacy standpoint, all the data is encrypted end-to-end between the client and the service. The cloud only sees encrypted blobs. Nothing can be decrypted over there. So the key question is like, okay, what do you guys or what do you Cisco store in the cloud? And the answer is nothing because we can't, we put ourselves in a position to not be able to do that.

